* You can acquire another {i:Erilaz Surcoat|Erilaz Surcoat|26940} if you tossed the other one.
** Ingredients are {i:Isgebind's Heart|Isgebind's Heart|3290}, {i:Galateia|Galateia|1769}, and {i:Molybdenum Ingot|Molybdenum Ingot|1711}; or you can trade 30 {i:H-P Bayld|H-P Bayld|8798}.
** When in possession of {@k} {k:"Quiescence"}, ingredients traded are reduced to {i:Isgebind's Heart|Isgebind's Heart|3290} or 15 {i:H-P Bayld|H-P Bayld|8798}.

